                                                "sense_id": "0868dd25-6f03-3d23-b8f7-6ec0b623fb73",
                                                "text": "We are to go and see Pope's new grotto, opened for the first time; then try Hampton Court, and see if Mrs. Howard will stake a little princely gold on a pool of basset."
                                            }
                                        ]
